"The branches %(branches)s are included: they share the company's books."
msgstr "Filialerna %(branches)s ingår: de delar bolagets bokföring."

#. module: l10n_se_sie4
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_sie4/models/sie_analysis.py:0
msgid ""
"The checksum (#KSUMMA %(declared)s) does not match the content "
"(%(computed)s): the file may have been changed after the export."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollsumman (#KSUMMA %(declared)s) stämmer inte med innehållet "
"(%(computed)s): filen kan ha ändrats efter exporten."

#. module: l10n_se_sie4
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_sie4/models/sie_analysis.py:0
msgid ""
"The company already has entries (posted or draft, from %(first)s to "
"%(last)s). The opening balance %(year)s would count the same balances twice:"
" untick 'Opening balance' to import the vouchers only, or import into a "
"company without entries."
msgstr ""
"Bolaget har redan verifikat (bokförda eller utkast, från %(first)s till "
"%(last)s). Den ingående balansen %(year)s skulle räkna samma saldon två "
"gånger: kryssa ur 'Ingående balans' för att bara importera verifikaten, "
"eller importera till ett bolag utan verifikat."

#. module: l10n_se_sie4
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_sie4/models/sie_analysis.py:0
msgid ""
"The company has no chart of accounts. Install one (Accounting settings) "
"before importing."
msgstr ""
"Bolaget har ingen kontoplan. Installera en (bokföringsinställningarna) innan"
" du importerar."

#. module: l10n_se_sie4
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_se_sie4/models/sie_analysis.py:0
